***	Complete and restore manual-page documentation.
	Many of the functions added after ixemul 48.2 do not yet have man
	pages.  Add documentation for the new interfaces and keep existing
	manual pages in sync with the current implementation.

	Manual-page generation is currently disabled in the Makefile because
	groff/nroff hangs during the build process.  Find a reliable way to
	generate the documentation without blocking the ixemul build.

